AYE WAARIS E SHABBIR AB AAJAO QUDARA.<br>
<br>
1.Aye Waaris E Shabbir Ab Aajao Qudara.<br>
 Aye Sahibe Tatheer Ghareebon Ka Sahara.<br>
<br>
2.Ek Aapse Ummeed Hai Aye Hujjate Aaqer.<br>
 Ho Jaayiey Ho Jaayiey Ab Daher May Zahir.<br>
 Pursaan E Haal Koun Hai Duniya May Humara....<br>
<br>
3.Har Samt Se Hai Zulm Ki Yalgaar Musalsal.<br>
 Har Ek Se Imaa Ko Hai Aazaar Musalal.<br>
 Dushwaar Huwa Jaata Hai Momin Ka Guzara.....<br>
<br>
4.Jis Khoon May Hai Ishq E Ali Or Gham E Sarwar.<br>
 Paani Ki Tarah Usko Bahate Hai Sitamgar.<br>
 Kya Aapko Iss Khoon Ka Behna Hai Gawara....<br>
<br>
5.Islam Jo Hai Aapki Ajdaad Ki Mehnat.<br>
 Phir Narghaye Aada Mayahai Bay Aas Ki Surat.<br>
 Duniya May Wohi Deen Hai Taqdeer Ka Maara....<br>
<br>
6.Hum Bichaye Huway Raahon May Pade Hain.<br>
 Hum Sar Pe Kafan Baandh Ke Taiiyar Khade Hain.<br>
 Ek Aapki Janib Se Bhi Hojayae Ishaara.....<br>
<br>
7.Aawaaz Lagati Hai Tumhe Karbobala Phir.<br>
 Kounain Me Goonje Wohi Halmin Ki Sada Phir.<br>
 Chamkega Yahi Deen Ki Kismat Ka ....<br>
<br>
 Aye Waarise Shabbir Ab Aajao Qudara..<br>
<br>
AZZ:-Ali Anjum Sadiq